NOTICE

This repository includes a derived table of CVE data (data/derived/cves.csv),
built from the U.S. National Vulnerability Database (NVD) by
scripts/fetch_nvd.py and scripts/derive_cves.py (see docs/decisions.md, D11).
The table contains only CVE identifiers, a service-family label, matched
product names, the CVSS version, the CVSS v3.x exploitability sub-score and
the publication date. It contains no CVE descriptions or references.


1. National Vulnerability Database (NVD)

This product uses the NVD API but is not endorsed or certified by the NVD.

The exploitability_score values in data/derived/cves.csv are NVD-generated
CVSS v3.x scores (NVD "Primary" scores, source nvd@nist.gov), i.e. works of
the U.S. Government.


